  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TA to Agus Pulangi scoping phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Environmental and Social Impact Assessment for the Rehabilitation of the Agus-Pulangi Hydropower Complex Project 2 (full ESIA for the preferred option) will inform on the environmental and social impacts and mitigation measures (including cost of mitigation) of the two options to rehabilitate the Agus-Pulangi Hydropower Complex. The ESIA will be conducted according to the requirement of the World Bank&#xbf;s Environmental and Social Framework (ESF) and relevant guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
